{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-10-07 11:00:00', 'title': "AIR PRODUCTS' NEW WORLD-SCALE LIQUID HYDROGEN PLANT IS ONSTREAM AT ITS LA PORTE, TEXAS FACILITY", 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., OCT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD), THE LEADING GLOBAL HYDROGEN PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS NEW LIQUID HYDROGEN PLANT AT ITS LA PORTE, TEXAS FACILITY IS ONSTREAM TO SUPPLY INCREASING DEMAND IN SEVERAL CUSTOMER MARKETS.'}